claim.claim-text:
at least one position marker (202; 502; 602; 702; 802; 902), the at least one position marker (202..902) extending along an axial direction, from a first end (504<1>) to a second end (504<2>), and having varying magnetic permeability from the first end to the second end;
at least one sensor (212) configured to be coupled to the rotor (130) and configured for producing, as the rotor (130) rotates about the longitudinal axis (A), at least one sensor signal in response to detecting passage of the at least one position marker (202...902); and
a control unit (220) communicatively coupled to the at least one sensor (212) and configured to generate a feedback signal indicative of the blade pitch angle in response to the at least one sensor signal received from the at least one sensor (212).
